strings.ui.settings.hw.autosetup_help:
Opens the automatic setup wizard with a plan preview and confirmation:
1) Checks and installs missing Python dependencies (.venv);
2) Selects and installs optimal ONNX Runtime (NVIDIA CUDA → DirectML → CPU);
3) Checks and downloads missing CUDA / cuDNN DLLs into ./cuda/;
4) Checks and downloads models/resources for all active modules;
5) Tunes optimal hardware, decoding, and camera codec parameters, saves config.json and applies immediately (or prompts restart if older native .dll/.pyd files are already loaded in memory).

strings.help.hardware.display_resize_method:
Frame Scaling Algorithm for Display
• nearest — fastest (lowest CPU usage);
• linear — optimal balance of quality and speed;
• lanczos — sharpest fine details (higher CPU usage).
